    <briefdescription>
<para>Top-level image-generation plugin implementing IImageGenerationBackend. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wires together:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1imggen_1_1_i_s_d_generator" kindref="compound">ISDGenerator</ref> (model inference – injected or <ref refid="classthemis_1_1imggen_1_1_s_d_stub_generator" kindref="compound">SDStubGenerator</ref>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1imggen_1_1_s_d_prompt_sanitizer" kindref="compound">SDPromptSanitizer</ref> (content policy)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>All generated images receive mandatory provenance fields:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>generation_timestamp (Unix epoch ms)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>prompt_hash (FNV-1a 64-bit hex of the sanitised prompt)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>plugin_version &quot;2.3.0&quot;</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread safety: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1imggen_1_1_s_d_plugin_1afec5f78bed193e25f65284b0409f96a6" kindref="member">generate()</ref>, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1imggen_1_1_s_d_plugin_1a7a2e8fa42667d96da42288644f690171" kindref="member">generateBatch()</ref>, and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1imggen_1_1_s_d_plugin_1af39475fc6b918d55cc35340e0ddc73d3" kindref="member">generateImg2Img()</ref> are serialised by an internal mutex. Statistics counters are updated atomically under the same lock. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
